      "created_at": "2025-03-18T09:54:15.720Z",
      "cooked": "<p>i have create site and i am using it from last 6 month that time erpnext app not install in site now i am try to install erpnext site error given “frappe.exceptions.ValidationError: ERPNext can only be installed on a fresh site where the setup wizard is not completed.<br>\nYou can reinstall this site (after saving your data) using: bench --site [sitename] reinstall”<br>\nanyone please help<br>\nwhat should i do in this case?</p>",
