      "id": 461624,
      "username": "ejaaz",
      "name": "Ejaaz Khan",
      "created_at": "2025-03-18T15:13:49.110Z",
      "cooked": "<p>ERPNext requires a fresh instance to install. You can do one of the following:</p>\n<p>Take a backup of your data, doctypes, and any other changes, and then import them after installing ERPNext, or use another workaround.</p>\n<p>Don’t touch the current site. Create a fresh new site, install Frappe and ERPNext, and then manually import data from the current site to the new site using the data import and export tools of Frappe.</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/ejaaz/{size}/84739_2.png",
      "trust_level": 2,
